<h2 id="_removal_of_deprecated_methods_in_org_asciidoctor_ast_document">Removal of deprecated methods in <code>org.asciidoctor.ast.Document</code></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Several methods in <code>org.asciidoctor.ast.Document</code> that were marked as <code>@Deprecated</code> have been removed.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>For each of the removed methods, the equivalent can be found below.</p>
</div>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="title">Removed deprecated methods</div>
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java">String doctitle()
boolean basebackend(String backend)</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="title">Final methods</div>
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java">String getDoctitle()
boolean isBasebackend(String backend)</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
